  "title": "Barcelona, Spain",
  "indexDescription": "A family trip to Barcelona in 2009.",
  "description": "From Granada we flew to Barcelona.  We stayed on the 6th floor of a high-rise condo in town.  We walked La Rambla, visited Park Güell and the Sagrada Família.  The Sagrada Família is not part of this collection; that's coming up next.",
